# Matrix Engineering — redesign preview
#
# This site has no build step: index.html, style.css, app.js, brochure.html and
# the product/team images are the deliverable and MUST stay tracked. Nothing
# here should ever match those. What follows is guarding against things that
# arrive by accident — local tooling, OS junk, and credentials.

# --- Credentials. Nothing in this list should ever exist in this repo. -------
# The Supabase publishable key in app.js is deliberate and safe (RLS enforces
# access; see CLAUDE.md). A service-role key, a .env, or a service-account JSON
# is not — those grant access on their own and must never be committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.keystore
secrets.json
service-account*.json
credentials*.json
supabase/.temp/
.supabase/

# --- Local tooling, if anyone ever adds a build or the Supabase CLI ---------
node_modules/
package-lock.json.bak
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.cache/
dist/
build/

# --- Editors and IDEs -------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- macOS ------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes

# --- Scratch ----------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.orig
*.rej
